// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2645129894" "I summon the power of the winds to shroud these shores!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P618661323" "I will blow you creatures away!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P348891018" "You shall not invade!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1787682589" "The winds will protect us!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P578314378" "Who goes there?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P541575216" "Another invader?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2365195235" "Our magic will suffice for you as well!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGTUATHA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P449248709" "Crude beast!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGTUATHA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P142198457" "You can't deal with us!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGTUATHA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2048594305" "Pets of the Red Caps!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGTUATHA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P295942842" "You disgust us!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGTUATHA_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2657260559" "Stay back!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGTUATHA_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P907083857" "Do you want a taste of the winds?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGTUATHA_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2015206481" "This doesn't concern you!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGTUATHA_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P483489524" "We will defend ourselves!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_READINGSPELLSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3542550556" "From the corners of the earth..."
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_READINGSPELLSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P694185032" "With the fury of our might..."
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_READINGSPELLSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1461377971" "With the rage of our spirit..."
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_READINGSPELLSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P173005405" "Pain and horror descend..."

// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_READINGSPELLSCROLL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2925989996" "I must finish the incantation!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_READINGSPELLSCROLL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3776795959" "Who interrupts!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_READINGSPELLSCROLL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4281539477" "You've spoiled my spell!"

// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_CHARGINGCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3622390157" "The Red Caps demand that you suffer!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_CHARGINGCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1639436668" "We are stronger than you!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_CHARGINGCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1702563147" "You can't hold us off forever!"

// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_CHARGINGCABAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P430513521" "This is our fight!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_CHARGINGCABAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1061441628" "You are not welcome here!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_CHARGINGCABAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2262878719" "We don't want you in Croatoa!"

// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3201494735" "Frail woman!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P361442542" "We will trample you to the dirt!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3789476005" "Your magic can't match our strength!"

// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGCABAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1012049615" "Get back, human!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGCABAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3082989046" "This battle belongs to us!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGCABAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3127461886" "These things are beyond your ken!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_TAUNTINGCABAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4212677098" "Do not interfere with us!"

// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_HOWLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1109654874" "Beat them back!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_HOWLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2400267863" "Bash them!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_HOWLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3606699490" "Make meat of them!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_HOWLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3503442935" "Break the Cabal!"

// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_HOWLING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2547167518" "Grrraaahh!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_HOWLING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P823904382" "Grrooowwwrr!"

// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_FRUSTRATEDYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3869472215" "We'll get you!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_FRUSTRATEDYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1515423517" "Your magic can't hold us forever!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_FRUSTRATEDYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2771469028" "You exaggerate your power!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_FRUSTRATEDYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2053610017" "You can't stop us for long!"

// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_FRUSTRATEDYELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2889641971" "What are you doing here?"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_FRUSTRATEDYELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P613950817" "Go!"
// CROATOA_TUATHA_SHOREDEFENSE_FRUSTRATEDYELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1572807740" "Leave us!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSUPPORTSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1629249228" "I will help you, sister!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSUPPORTSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1578396570" "Let my power join with yours!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSUPPORTSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1642991429" "Winds, aid me!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSUPPORTSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P924651741" "You've broken my concentration!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSUPPORTSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1076133056" "My spell! You've spoiled it!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SHOREDEFENSE_CASTINGSUPPORTSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2383964008" "You'll pay for ruining my incantation!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P273595655" "And so the Red Caps came. And so disaster followed."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1441111742" "Each man they took from us: fathers, brothers, husbands, sons."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3495093212" "And so we resolved. We would be the Red Caps playthings no longer."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1694355549" "Our pain fuels their evil. But it also fuels our resolve."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGSCROLL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P454191188" "Who interrupts?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGSCROLL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3523975180" "The sacred text must not be interrupted!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGSCROLL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3960563438" "These words are precious to us!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGSCROLL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3505653993" "How dare you mock our pain?"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STORYTELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3256679092" "Our tears have made this tree grow large. Its gnarled shape reflects our misery."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STORYTELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3204368133" "The Red Caps are the truest evil we have ever known. We must destroy them."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STORYTELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3538999123" "This tree honors our dead, slain at the hands of the Red Caps."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STORYTELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3752053208" "This is sacred ground!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STORYTELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P73337212" "We will not allow you to hear of our anguish!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STORYTELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1814118224" "These words are for the Cabal alone!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGBOOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4087504113" "It says here that the winds are strong against the Red Caps."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGBOOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1991253017" "This passage is confusing."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGBOOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1379893378" "It says that the Red Caps' evil is unmatched, even by the demons of the netherworlds."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGBOOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3517538057" "I don't understand this section."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGBOOK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2151406055" "We're busy!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGBOOK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2399846518" "Don't bother us!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_READINGBOOK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2605347457" "Don't meddle in what you don't understand!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STANDINGGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2100912507" "Never fear, sisters."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STANDINGGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2638399635" "I will protect the ceremony."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STANDINGGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1853315070" "None shall pass."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STANDINGGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3234735361" "Taste the winds!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_STANDINGGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3714163970" "You'll not harm my sisters!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_ENCOURAGINGGROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P150282243" "Speak, sisters!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_ENCOURAGINGGROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P291927954" "Tell us the story!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_ENCOURAGINGGROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3054644785" "Let your words sing out!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_ENCOURAGINGGROUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P158880143" "You shall not venture near!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_ENCOURAGINGGROUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2500772611" "Fear the Cabal!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_ENCOURAGINGGROUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2845255679" "Fear us!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_BOWINGWORSHIP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4251869797" "We honor the memory of the past!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_BOWINGWORSHIP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4134980490" "We praise the winds!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_BOWINGWORSHIP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P298583797" "We vow to exterminate the foul creatures!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_BOWINGWORSHIP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2690591627" "You dishonor our past!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_BOWINGWORSHIP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3843048837" "You plague us!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_BOWINGWORSHIP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1318256353" "Do you serve the Red Caps?"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_SITTINGCASTINGSMALLSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1283195117" "Winds, work our will."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_SITTINGCASTINGSMALLSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1388644983" "Winds, scour this land."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_SITTINGCASTINGSMALLSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3217238436" "Winds, carry the scent of the Red Caps far from here."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_SITTINGCASTINGSMALLSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2255586249" "May our dead sleep peacefully."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_SITTINGCASTINGSMALLSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1852534166" "You will break my spell!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_SITTINGCASTINGSMALLSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3331677175" "You will ruin everything!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GIANTTREEWORSHIP_SITTINGCASTINGSMALLSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3721284348" "Fool! You've disrupted my magic!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_BORDERLOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2944661492" "Keep your senses keen."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_BORDERLOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1650645781" "We must protect ourselves against the Red Caps."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_BORDERLOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2608274610" "Do not let anyone cross these borders."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_BORDERLOOKOUT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2098303096" "Stop!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_BORDERLOOKOUT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1904400959" "The Cabal owns these lands!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_BORDERLOOKOUT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3700193929" "The Cabal will not permit your incursion!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_BORDERLOOKOUT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1808591387" "Halt!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_KNEELINGCASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1579184328" "This spell will protect our lands."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_KNEELINGCASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3736537383" "The winds will guard us."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_KNEELINGCASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1360396731" "No one will step over the border without our knowledge."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_KNEELINGCASTINGSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2836576695" "Who disturbs us?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_KNEELINGCASTINGSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1544759546" "Sunset Ridge is ours!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_KNEELINGCASTINGSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1576053672" "Stay back, or die at the hands of the Cabal!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_CROSSARMEDDEFIANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2670652988" "None shall evade us."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_CROSSARMEDDEFIANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P737472908" "We will triumph over the misery of Croatoa."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_CROSSARMEDDEFIANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1399185731" "We will remain safe within these lands."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_CROSSARMEDDEFIANCE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3477883740" "You are not of the Cabal!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_CROSSARMEDDEFIANCE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P806526336" "You have ventured too far!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_CROSSARMEDDEFIANCE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P612850571" "You have entered our realm. You will not leave it alive!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_PATROLLINGBEHINDLINE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4240727356" "I'm keeping my eyes open."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_PATROLLINGBEHINDLINE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2161245053" "I will use the winds to extend my sight."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_PATROLLINGBEHINDLINE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2650233337" "Don't worry. We're not about to let anyone through."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_PATROLLINGBEHINDLINE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2452849455" "Trespasser!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_PATROLLINGBEHINDLINE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P255069046" "Red Cap spy!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_PATROLLINGBEHINDLINE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4289200648" "Fiend!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2845219531" "The winds will obey you if you show them respect."
// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P689943355" "Remember, the winds are our allies against the Red Caps."
// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1398065090" "Pay attention. Learning to summon the winds is no mean feat."
// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3767106832" "Your skill is growing."
// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3935665900" "I am proud of your new abilities."
// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3810293365" "You please the Cabal with your growing strength."
// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2005380530" "You will soon be a great asset to the Cabal."

// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2850548965" "You don't know who you're dealing with!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4217227063" "You interrupt a most deadly art!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1175277450" "You should not disturb those you do not understand!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_MAGICINSTRUCT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4061450892" "We are more powerful than you imagine!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2349586734" "Can we truly stay safe?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3489503913" "Can we keep the Red Caps out?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3624955481" "Is there any hope of maintaining our borders?"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_SITTING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P726212334" "No!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_SITTING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2905072952" "We must save ourselves!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_SITTING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1640245621" "We have to kill this one!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GUARDINGBORDER_SITTING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P146096612" "We can't allow another invasion!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_REDCAPVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3744440131" "Leave me be!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_REDCAPVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1971404648" "Silly witches, no match for me."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_REDCAPVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3463859449" "I be free soon. Then you writhe!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_REDCAPVICTIM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1665755711" "Hee hee hee! Trouble coming!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_REDCAPVICTIM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3280483039" "This be a good fight!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_REDCAPVICTIM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4242513358" "Blood soon be spilling."

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1102896956" "I have it!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2998433774" "I can't hold it forever!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1594370520" "The creature's magic is strong. My spell won't hold long."

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1252351407" "Hurry! I can't maintain my concentration!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1926170137" "The spell is breaking!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3047658701" "No! You've ruined my spell!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_TALKINGTOHOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P975238969" "Now, foul demon, we will learn your secrets."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_TALKINGTOHOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2818095776" "You will help us learn how to get rid of your kind."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_TALKINGTOHOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3793542624" "Soon, the Red Caps will be only an unpleasant memory."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_TALKINGTOHOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4206311372" "It won't be long before I have your secrets."

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_TALKINGTOHOSTAGE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3252461611" "Not now!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_TALKINGTOHOSTAGE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3524837218" "This is important!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_TALKINGTOHOSTAGE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P884294667" "We must hold off this one!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_THREATENINGHOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3404333650" "And when we're done with you, vermin, you're dead."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_THREATENINGHOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4132854358" "I hope you won't survive our experiments."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_THREATENINGHOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P370980084" "I cannot wait to wipe you filthy beasts from this world."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_THREATENINGHOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1930395454" "Breathe your last, Red Cap."

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_THREATENINGHOSTAGE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2227479531" "You'll spoil all our work!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_THREATENINGHOSTAGE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3159154148" "We need this creature!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_THREATENINGHOSTAGE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1975283438" "Guard the beast."

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4076417233" "They are truly disgusting."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2547744760" "I can hardly stand the smell."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3341060778" "I loathe these things."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P727073801" "I can barely control my hatred."

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3874858321" "Get out of here!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P823688120" "You won't stay our hand!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3395134353" "You must work for the Red Caps!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P265992668" "You would free this creature? You'll have to go through me!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_LOITERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2758639277" "We need answers, and soon."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_LOITERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3405202891" "We'll have to make this fast."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_LOITERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P267604631" "Do what you need to, then kill it."
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_LOITERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2006704416" "We can't keep it around forever. It will draw the others."

// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_LOITERING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2679664808" "We won't brook interference!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_REDCAPTRAP_LOITERING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3845811820" "We will finish what we started!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_SHOVELLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2462987593" "These roots enhance natural magic gifts."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_SHOVELLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2603226997" "These roots are essential."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_SHOVELLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1802174453" "We need a big harvest."

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_SHOVELLING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P138431106" "Protect the roots!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_SHOVELLING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1554743558" "Keep the crop safe!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_SHOVELLING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3045019284" "Don't let the stranger near the harvest!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGBYHAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P85312137" "The crop has been thin this year."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGBYHAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1587973215" "The yield is unimpressive."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGBYHAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1466779230" "We're going to have to find more."

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGBYHAND_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P371906287" "Have you come to steal our prize?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGBYHAND_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2035153346" "These are not for you!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGBYHAND_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1791110521" "I will not let you steal from the Cabal!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P701169738" "It's the constant battling. The roots can no longer flourish here."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P294502583" "Yes. The roots have been getting more rare."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2938697735" "So far, these roots have resisted any attempt to replant them."

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2946484298" "How did this one learn of the roots' power?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4154047216" "We mustn't lose them!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3301966137" "Who are you to disrupt us?"

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_LOITERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2720447171" "Are we nearly done? I don't feel safe here."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_LOITERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1236575954" "Finish the harvest and let's get back to the tree."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_LOITERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1339217865" "This place isn't safe. Grab the roots and let's go."

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_LOITERING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P301634020" "The Cabal owns this earth!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_LOITERING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P108472514" "Get away from here!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGWITHPICKAXE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1097386376" "This reminds me of my old life, before Croatoa."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGWITHPICKAXE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4201437338" "I can almost remember what it was like back in Roanoke."
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGWITHPICKAXE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2202503862" "There's a simple pleasure in farming that I miss."

// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGWITHPICKAXE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1915003241" "This is our find!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGWITHPICKAXE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1098003242" "How dare you invade?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_FARMINGFORROOTS_DIGGINGWITHPICKAXE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1238408742" "Keep away!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_SKYPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1470668330" "Strange. Things look so peaceful from up here."
// CROATOA_CABAL_SKYPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1672666499" "I see no Red Caps yet."
// CROATOA_CABAL_SKYPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3136767599" "This world will soon feel the sting of the Cabal."

// CROATOA_CABAL_SKYPATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1917819061" "These skies are rightly ours!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SKYPATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3551624757" "I will hurl you to the ground!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_AMBUSHFROMDOOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P37428701" "I have you now!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_AMBUSHFROMDOOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P508407121" "Hah! You're mine!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_AMBUSHFROMDOOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3107426769" "I will gut you!"

// CROATOA_FAERIES_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_FLITTERINGFAERIES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P0" ""


// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P142597644" "We must root out the Red Caps!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3409891469" "Danger could come from any side."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P196546088" "With the Red Caps around, even the ground can be treacherous."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3391275027" "You meddle in a fight that is not yours!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1688838428" "Stay out of this, stranger!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P994705542" "Leave us to our battle!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_DEFIANTSTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2566413049" "We will not be defeated!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_DEFIANTSTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2857103207" "We will stand against them!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_DEFIANTSTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3449488808" "We are more than a match for the beasts!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_DEFIANTSTANCE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1916899487" "Get away!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_DEFIANTSTANCE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3424120949" "Get you gone!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_DEFIANTSTANCE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3933404692" "Go hence!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_MENACING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P88485249" "I will slaughter the Red Caps!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_MENACING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3642380220" "The demons will know my fury!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_MENACING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P844903144" "I will call down the heavens!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_MENACING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P461448564" "You will die here!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_MENACING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1220195001" "Your bones will rot in the Vale!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_MENACING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1569462323" "You are not welcome!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_CASTINGSMALLSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3184444363" "This spell will help protect us."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_CASTINGSMALLSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2601522674" "The winds are strong in this place."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_CASTINGSMALLSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2089940612" "I can give us a better chance against them."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_CASTINGSMALLSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P151444985" "My spell!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_CASTINGSMALLSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2384700966" "You disturb us at the worst time."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALEDEFENSE_CASTINGSMALLSPELL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1315480617" "You'll pay for this disruption!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_SPRITELIGHTS_GUARDINGLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P609712331" "The sprites will aid us."
// CROATOA_CABAL_SPRITELIGHTS_GUARDINGLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2089078645" "We must keep the sprites alive."
// CROATOA_CABAL_SPRITELIGHTS_GUARDINGLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1500829331" "The sprites are here to assist."

// CROATOA_CABAL_SPRITELIGHTS_GUARDINGLIGHT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1006466835" "Do not harm these gentle creatures!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SPRITELIGHTS_GUARDINGLIGHT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P106873337" "Protect the sprites!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_SPRITELIGHTS_GUARDINGLIGHT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2893690378" "Strengthen us, sprites!"

// CROATOA_NPC_HARASSEDBYCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P809573457" "Let me go!"
// CROATOA_NPC_HARASSEDBYCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3655109130" "Please! Please, don't hurt me!"
// CROATOA_NPC_HARASSEDBYCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P913315743" "Leave me alone!"
// CROATOA_NPC_HARASSEDBYCABAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4275840250" "I just want to get home!"

// PL_ThankHero :
"P64704357" "Thank you so much!"
// PL_ThankHero :
"P818219803" "You've saved me!"
// PL_ThankHero :
"P120489208" "I'll never forget this!"

// CROATOA_NPC_HARASSEDBYCABAL_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P742705665" "Those women are nuts!"
// CROATOA_NPC_HARASSEDBYCABAL_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1154854465" "They wouldn't let me go!"
// CROATOA_NPC_HARASSEDBYCABAL_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2794739117" "I'm eternally grateful!"
// CROATOA_NPC_HARASSEDBYCABAL_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P4245599013" "I believe you can really help this village."

// CROATOA_CABAL_HARASSINGMALE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P670401478" "A human male. It has been a long time since I set eyes on one."
// CROATOA_CABAL_HARASSINGMALE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4081508471" "Perhaps you could rejuvenate the Cabal."
// CROATOA_CABAL_HARASSINGMALE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1397506318" "I wonder how you would fare in the woods?"

// CROATOA_CABAL_HARASSINGMALE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2824052123" "You will not steal this one from me!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_HARASSINGMALE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P727027973" "I will defend my prize!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_HARASSINGMALE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3972482904" "This is no business of yours!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_TORCHCARRIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2494660883" "We should take this land."
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_TORCHCARRIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3031859499" "Capture any males you see."
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_TORCHCARRIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3359556640" "The Red Caps prescence is not yet strong here."
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_TORCHCARRIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2940237225" "We have the might to crush the Fir Bolg and Tuatha."
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_TORCHCARRIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2638713116" "This village will soon be ours."
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_TORCHCARRIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2960475375" "They call this place Salamanca. A strange word."

// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_TORCHCARRIER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1004750513" "Get back!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_TORCHCARRIER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4126674403" "A stranger!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_TORCHCARRIER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1619076749" "Sisters, defend yourselves!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_SPELLCAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2112226139" "I am working a scrying spell."
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_SPELLCAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2541941412" "I'll uncover any nearby enemies."
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_SPELLCAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P306790366" "I believe we can dominate Salamanca, my sisters."

// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_SPELLCAST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P887147648" "Who are you?"
// CROATOA_CABAL_WITCHHUNT_SPELLCAST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3878240855" "You would stand agaisnt the Cabal?"

// CROATOA_OUTDOORMISSION6_CABAL_DOORAMBUSH_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3614413503" "Our sisters need us!"

// CROATOA_OUTPORTALMISSION6_CABAL_PORTALAMBUSH_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2680319901" "You! You have come to harm our sisters?"

// CROATOA_CABAL_OUTDOORMISSION6_SKYPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P208135098" "We must keep watch while the spell is completed."

// CROATOA_CABAL_OUTDOORMISSION6_SKYPATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1073112878" "An intruder! Attack!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_OUTDOORMISSION6_STORYTELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3276574299" "And so the experiments began. The work was difficult at first, but it became easier with time."


// CROATOA_CABAL_OUTDOORMISSION6_READINGBOOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P658377465" "I cannot see how to proceed. The text is too obscure."

// CROATOA_CABAL_OUTDOORMISSION6_READINGBOOK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P339737341" "You would stop our work?"

// CROATOA_CABAL_OUTDOORMISSION6_BOWINGWORSHIP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2680714094" "The power of the Cabal must be supreme!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_OUTDOORMISSION6_BOWINGWORSHIP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P607606054" "You would ruin the Cabal!"

// CROATOA_SALAMANCAFIRBOLG_TALKINGWITHCABALINACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1397914171" "You hate the Red Caps as we do?"
// CROATOA_SALAMANCAFIRBOLG_TALKINGWITHCABALINACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1797043158" "What can we do to aid you against our enemy?"
// CROATOA_SALAMANCAFIRBOLG_TALKINGWITHCABALINACTIVE_TEXT :
"P478546325" "You are wise to fear the demons to the north. They are most cruel."

// CROATOA_SALAMANCAFIRBOLG_TALKINGWITHCABALALERTED_TEXT :
"P1402600900" "Who disturbs?"
// CROATOA_SALAMANCAFIRBOLG_TALKINGWITHCABALALERTED_TEXT :
"P1721900353" "This is serious business!"

// CROATOA_SALAMANCACABAL_TALKINGWITHFIRBOLGINACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1740178989" "We must rip them from this world."
// CROATOA_SALAMANCACABAL_TALKINGWITHFIRBOLGINACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3997484348" "We must destroy them, unto the last."
// CROATOA_SALAMANCACABAL_TALKINGWITHFIRBOLGINACTIVE_TEXT :
"P578466174" "We intend to fight back against the creatures. Will you join us?"

// CROATOA_SALAMANCACABAL_TALKINGWITHFIRBOLGALERTED_TEXT :
"P2390343520" "You! A friend of the demons?"
// CROATOA_SALAMANCACABAL_TALKINGWITHFIRBOLGALERTED_TEXT :
"P2664128184" "You would keep us from our task?"
// CROATOA_SALAMANCACABAL_TALKINGWITHFIRBOLGALERTED_TEXT :
"P2518028108" "We cannot afford interference!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_BINDINGSOULTOFIRBOLG_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1975080946" "Your humanity will be restored."
// CROATOA_CABAL_BINDINGSOULTOFIRBOLG_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3522872826" "Be a victim of the Red Caps no longer."
// CROATOA_CABAL_BINDINGSOULTOFIRBOLG_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1731183144" "Rejoin this mortal world."

// CROATOA_CABAL_BINDINGSOULTOFIRBOLG_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2748419770" "Stop there!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_BINDINGSOULTOFIRBOLG_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3065348503" "You have disrupted my spell!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_BINDINGSOULTOFIRBOLG_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3680517602" "You have ruined everything, meddler!"

// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALE_PREPARINGFORWAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2250893931" "We must not lose to these creatures."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALE_PREPARINGFORWAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3614771943" "The Red Caps deserve to suffer as we have."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALE_PREPARINGFORWAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1002251367" "Remember our casuse."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALE_PREPARINGFORWAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3539587109" "Do not falter."
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALE_PREPARINGFORWAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1191253017" "Give no quarter."

// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALE_PREPARINGFORWAR_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2580559117" "We are attacked!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALE_PREPARINGFORWAR_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2774393228" "Stand and defend yourselves!"
// CROATOA_CABAL_GRIMVALE_PREPARINGFORWAR_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P522254802" "Who are you to meddle in this affair?"

